{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/508619b36677d30d6e17dde7a710459a.avif?t=1769939407\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy Roads is an endless driving game that offers rapid-paced gameplay on procedurally created roadscapes. The main gameplay is simple but stimulating: speed, accuracy, and the constant struggle of increasing speed while keeping control of the vehicle while driving on challenging roads to get the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can earn points to unlock a wide range of unique vehicles, from small hatchback cars to classic sports cars, each of which has unique driving characteristics. Randomly assigned tasks are introduced throughout the gameplay, which offer players supplementary challenges and goals. Completing these tasks earns players experience points, which allows them to gain mastery of each vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In World Mode, players can go on a bold adventure across the world by driving the distance between two countries. Once the player completes the distance, the country is marked as traveled. The ultimate goal is to visit all the countries of the world through skill, endurance, and exploratory adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arcade Mode, players can experience a score-based gameplay style similar to classic endless runners. The player must avoid oncoming objects while driving through gates that increase the score multiplier. The difficulty level increases as the player survives for a longer period of time, requiring skill and accuracy to the highest level to attain the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the high-speed driving experience, players can engage in a relaxed and strategic gameplay experience in Garden Mode, where players can grow crops, build structures, raise animals, sleep through the nights, and prepare meals. Prepared meals can be equipped before playing Endless or Arcade modes to grant players temporary boosts to enhance driving performances.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/1479e3130cd8d38b3d3291b86a32c831.avif?t=1769939407\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Gameplay with Procedurally Generated Roads</strong>: A new, unique road is created with every playthrough</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/628c778eaa3c05639ba47b159e5fc469.poster.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/628c778eaa3c05639ba47b159e5fc469.webm?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/628c778eaa3c05639ba47b159e5fc469.mp4?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-based scoring</strong>: Players accumulate points based on their speed, creating a risk-reward scenario.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/607c6cf6e2db2066ab7ca52f221e6ad4.poster.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/607c6cf6e2db2066ab7ca52f221e6ad4.webm?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/607c6cf6e2db2066ab7ca52f221e6ad4.mp4?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Endless Mode</i>:\u00a0Engage in high-speed racing, aiming to survive and score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arcade Mode</i>:\u00a0Participate in an endless runner game, overcoming obstacles, passing through score multiplier gates, and attempting to accumulate the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Racing Mode</i>:\u00a0This involves racing against one, two, or three of your friends in quick racing sessions that test skill, speed, and expertise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Garden</i>:\u00a0Plant crops, build structures, tend to animals, prepare meals, and survive the night to obtain performance-enhancing foods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>World Mode</i>: A unique challenge where you travel the real-life distance between countries, with the goal of visiting every country in the world.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car collection</strong>: Unlock a growing garage of vehicles using the points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/f18a3f2f54320ce29c148d4377523bf2.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=174 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car mastery system</strong>: Each vehicle has its own mastery progression, allowing players to improve performance, unlock new abilities, and specialize in their favourite cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random tasks &amp; challenges</strong>: Complete objectives during gameplay for bonus experience points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization rewards</strong>: Unlock new visual options and upgrades as you master each car.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/39c4ac8d453edce64ef86819494a47c8.poster.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/39c4ac8d453edce64ef86819494a47c8.webm?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/39c4ac8d453edce64ef86819494a47c8.mp4?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge Music Library:</strong>\u00a0Players have access to over 400 songs from 14 genres. They include jazz, pop, rock, trap, lo-fi hip hop, classical, house, phonk, electronic, funky, ambient, hip hop, dance, and EDM music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather &amp; seasonal changes:\u00a0</strong>Experience rain, snow, or storms during gameplay. Seasonal changes occur throughout the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/ab88248a963229d91ac337c8cbf0e8e1.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=360 /></span>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tiny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4028070/be5048e928788772769d6920b63eaeacc49ef2f0.jpg"},{"name":"Glauke-288","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu