d gameplay style similar to classic endless runners. The player must avoid oncoming objects while driving through gates that increase the score multiplier. The difficulty level increases as the player survives for a longer period of time, requiring skill and accuracy to the highest level to attain the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the high-speed driving experience, players can engage in a relaxed and strategic gameplay experience in Garden Mode, where players can grow crops, build structures, raise animals, sleep through the nights, and prepare meals. Prepared meals can be equipped before playing Endless or Arcade modes to grant players temporary boosts to enhance driving performances.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/1479e3130cd8d38b3d3291b86a32c831.avif?t=1769939407\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Gameplay with Procedurally Generated Roads</strong>: A new, unique road is created with every playthrough</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/628c778eaa3c05639ba47b159e5fc469.poster.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/628c778eaa3c05639ba47b159e5fc469.webm?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/628c778eaa3c05639ba47b159e5fc469.mp4?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-based scoring</strong>: Players accumulate points based on their speed, creating a risk-reward scenario.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/607c6cf6e2db2066ab7ca52f221e6ad4.poster.avif?t=1769939407\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/607c6cf6e2db2066ab7ca52f221e6ad4.webm?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/607c6cf6e2db2066ab7ca52f221e6ad4.mp4?t=1769939407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Endless Mode</i>:\u00a0Engage in high-speed racing, aiming to survive and score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arcade Mode</i>:\u00a0Participate in an endless runner game, overcoming obstacles, passing through score multiplier gates, and attempting to accumulate the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Racing Mode</i>:\u00a0This involves racing against one, two, or three of your friends in quick racing sessions that test skill, speed, and expertise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Garden</i>:\u00a0Plant crops, build structures, tend to animals, prepare meals, and survive the night to obtain performance-enhancing foods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>World Mode</i>: A unique challenge where you travel the real-life distance between countries, with the goal of visiting every country in the world.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car collection</strong>: Unlock a growing garage of vehicles using the points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_i